  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/AgM9eUynbx\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"discord-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\">\n</a>\n&nbsp;\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnether-dungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\">\n</a>\n&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/durts-nether-dungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"curseforge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\">\n</a>\n&nbsp;\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@DurtMods\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"youtube-plural\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\">\n</a>\n&nbsp;\n</p><br><hr><br><h2>🚧 開發中 🚧</h2><p><strong>⚠️ 警告：此模組目前仍在開發中。</strong></p><ul>\n<li>模組可能 <strong>不穩定</strong> 且 <strong>包含錯誤</strong></li>\n<li>部分功能與內容可能 <strong>缺失</strong></li>\n<li><strong>指南與文件</strong> 尚未提供</li>\n<li>如遇任何問題或要回報錯誤，請透過 <strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/AgM9eUynbx\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></strong> 聯繫我們</li>\n</ul><h2>關於</h2><p><strong>地獄地城</strong> 是一個擴展地獄維度內容的模組，以原版風格新增了許多有趣的新機制。這個模組將使地獄維度的探索更加引人入勝且多樣化。</p><p>我們目前正在開發三個大型更新，將為遊戲帶來大量迷人且獨特的機制。敬請期待令人興奮的新功能與改進！</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/m9Ae6Puo/images/71b8f183576edbc99cfa4c24d6c0068e5b854a35.png\" alt=\"開發路線圖\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/m9Ae6Puo/images/8d76787b1ac466d2a7d234f02b9cb5be38f48355.png\" alt=\"海報\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/m9Ae6Puo/images/5874761b1fd4dd87cda4a313d27ac5347f748cf8.png\" alt=\"豬布林投擲者\"></p>",
